<title>USA: Zomax Optical Media Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Zomax Optical Media Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	     1996</p>
<p>									    (a)</p>
<p> Sales					$5,435,571     $3,768,134</p>
<p> Cost of Sales			     4,086,252	2,700,763</p>
<p> Gross Profit				1,349,319	1,067,371</p>
<p>Selling, General and</p>
<p>  Administrative Expenses		  896,610	  684,868</p>
<p> Operating Income			    452,709	  382,503</p>
<p> Interest Expense			   (74,475)	 (88,893)</p>
<p> Interest Income				80,116	   14,232</p>
<p> Income Before Income Taxes		458,350	  307,842</p>
<p> Income Taxes				  180,000	  121,000</p>
<p> Net Income				    278,350	  186,842</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			     0.06	     0.07</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number of</p>
<p>  Shares Outstanding		     4,390,075	2,800,000</p>
<p>(a) The pro forma statement of operations for 1996 reflects the historical statement of operations data of the predecessor Partnership as if the Partnership had been treated as a taxable entity for income tax purposes (assuming a 39% effective tax rate).</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
